ReadMe template

The README shall describe the overall project structure and provide a high-level explanation of each major software subsystem. It should also include the commands required to run.

Before considering a file documented, verify:
•	File has a summary at the top
•	Summary explains the physical/robot purpose
•	Major methods are documented
•	Method inputs are documented
•	Method outputs are documented
•	Units are specified
•	Important connections to other methods/files are documented
•	Testing method is identified
•	README structure reflects major files/directories
•	Commits clearly describe changes